From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:01:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] RenderManager: set the output mode before the first frame

The mode set for a new stream sits inside the render loop's wait for
the kernel's video started flag. HDR and DV packets start on the GUI
mode, the set drops them and they start again, and the first frames
play on the old refresh rate. An earlier set needs the meson_hdmi
same-mode check and amdv output query that decide the DV link format.
